<title>UK: DePfa sets 750 million mark bond due July 2012.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 750 million mark bond due July 2012.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DEM   COUPON     7.65	MATURITY    02.JUL.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FEES   UNDISCLOSED   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
